      "message": "Javadoc should always be formatted like :\n\n    /**\n     * One-line description of what this DOES\n     *\n     * Detailed description...\n     */\n\nSo here you should have something like\n\n    /**\n     * Construct a new VpnTransportInfo object.\n     *\n     * This is intended to be used for setting the keepalive value\n     */",
